<title>USA: Dow gains more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow gains more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average gained more than 50 points in less than 10 minutes of trading Friday.</p>
<p>At 9:38 a.m. EDT/1438 GMT the index of 30 blue-chip issues was up 50.43 points at 7,704.68, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
